Your Corruption, Drain Life, Drain Soul, and Shadowflame spells have a 4% chance for your next Shadow Bolt or Seed of Corruption spell becomes an instant cast and consumes 25% less mana.

This Shadow Bolt deals 20% more damage to monsters. 

@ext:Deals 25% less damage to players.:ext@

@ext:This effect can only occur every 5 seconds.:ext@
